---
/**
 * Hero: an example quote request as a chat thread. Clearly labelled as an example (not a real client).
 * Sequence: question pops in → "typing" → reply → customer confirms. Then the phone floats gently.
 */
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---
<figure class="chat relative z-10 mx-auto w-full max-w-md lg:mx-0">
  <figcaption class="mb-3 text-[0.95rem] text-white/80">Voorbeeld: zo gaat een aanvraag via WhatsApp</figcaption>
  <div class="chat-float overflow-hidden rounded-[1.5rem] bg-surface shadow-lift">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 bg-primary-strong px-4 py-3 text-white">
      <span class="relative grid h-10 w-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-white font-display text-sm font-extrabold text-primary" aria-hidden="true">
        F&amp;D
        <span class="online absolute -right-0.5 -bottom-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 rounded-full border-2 border-primary-strong bg-online"></span>
      </span>
      <span class="leading-tight">
        <strong class="block font-semibold">{site.name}</strong>
        <span class="text-sm text-white/80">Reageert {site.responseTime}</span>
      </span>
    </div>

    <ol class="space-y-3 px-4 py-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-snug" aria-label="Voorbeeldgesprek">
      <li class="chat-in ml-auto max-w-[85%] rounded-bubble rounded-br-sm bg-bubble-out px-4 py-3 text-ink shadow-card" style="--d: 0.5s; --o: right">
        <span class="sr-only">Klant, 09:12:</span>
        Goedemorgen! Wij zijn een fysiopraktijk in Hengelo, ongeveer 140 m² met 2 toiletten. Wat kost schoonmaak 2x per week?
        <span class="mt-2 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-muted"><Icon name="camera" class="h-4 w-4" /> 2 foto’s</span>
        <span class="mt-1 flex items-center justify-end gap-1 text-xs text-muted">
          <time>09:12</time>
          <svg class="ticks h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 13l4 4L14 8M10 15l2 2 9-9" /></svg>
        </span>
      </li>

      <li class="chat-typing max-w-[40%] rounded-bubble rounded-bl-sm bg-bubble-in px-4 py-3 shadow-card" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="flex gap-1"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
      </li>

      <li class="chat-in max-w-[88%] rounded-bubble rounded-bl-sm bg-bubble-in px-4 py-3 text-ink shadow-card" style="--d: 2.4s">
        <span class="sr-only">F&amp;D Schoonmaak, 09:13:</span>
        Goedemorgen Anouk, dank voor de foto’s. U krijgt vandaag nog een vaste prijs per beurt, met de schoonmaakchecklist erbij. Mag ik u om 11:00 even bellen?
        <time class="mt-1 block text-right text-xs text-muted">09:13</time>
      </li>

      <li class="chat-in ml-auto max-w-[70%] rounded-bubble rounded-br-sm bg-bubble-out px-4 py-3 text-ink shadow-card" style="--d: 3.4s; --o: right">
        <span class="sr-only">Klant, 09:14:</span>
        Prima, tot straks!
        <time class="mt-1 block text-right text-xs text-muted">09:14</time>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</figure>

<style>
  /* Typing dots between the question and the reply */
  .chat-typing {
    opacity: 0;
    animation:
      typing-in 0.3s ease 1.1s forwards,
      typing-out 0s linear 2.4s forwards;
  }
  .chat-typing i {
    display: block;
    width: 0.45rem;
    height: 0.45rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--color-muted);
    animation: dot 1s infinite ease-in-out;
  }
  .chat-typing i:nth-child(2) {
    animation-delay: 0.15s;
  }
  .chat-typing i:nth-child(3) {
    animation-delay: 0.3s;
  }
  /* Read receipts turn blue when the reply arrives */
  .ticks {
    animation: read 0.3s ease 2.3s forwards;
  }
  .online {
    animation: online 2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes typing-in {
    to {
      opacity: 1;
    }
  }
  @keyframes typing-out {
    to {
      display: none;
      height: 0;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 0;
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }
  @keyframes dot {
    0%,
    80%,
    100% {
      opacity: 0.3;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
    40% {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(-3px);
    }
  }
  @keyframes read {
    to {
      color: var(--color-brand-cyan);
    }
  }
  @keyframes online {
    0%,
    100% {
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgb(61 220 132 / 0.6);
    }
    50% {
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px rgb(61 220 132 / 0);
    }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .chat-typing {
      display: none;
    }
    .ticks {
      animation: none;
      color: var(--color-brand-cyan);
    }
    .online {
      animation: none;
    }
  }
</style>
